WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:03.220
Previously on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.330
You said that you only have one goal.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.590
To kill the Ignis.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:16.160
So you're destroying the network 
and plunging the world into chaos.

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:21.500
This wouldn't have happened if 
you simply gave me that Ignis.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.500
Playmaker!  Above!

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:34.480
When our minds are one, Revolver 
is no match for us!  Right?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.880
It seems you couldn't decipher it, 
so you believed what that Ignis said.

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:42.020
However...

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:47.370
What's important is that instead 
of telling you the truth...

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:52.030
...that Ignis pretended to lose its 
memories and kept misleading you.

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.700
There's nothing between me and him.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.910
Umm...  Above you!

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.390
As you wish, I'll show it to you!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.120
This light...  Can't be...

00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.740
I can't stay quiet!

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:14.220
I don't care if you trust me or not!

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.860
If you lose, I'm dead too!

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:20.340
Flash Charge Dragon attacks you directly!

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.400
Dirty Rush Supremacy!

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:33.610
Playmaker!  Are you okay?

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:36.980
Blast Powder Dragon's effect!

00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:45.490
When a monster powered up by this card 
deals battle damage, it gains 800 ATK.

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:50.140
What?  If we take this 
attack, we're out of LP!

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:51.860
This is bad!

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:56.130
This is the end, Playmaker!

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.340
Blast Powder Dragon attacks you directly!

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:26.710
I run Across the universe

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.880
At the speed of light

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.750
Begin Loading

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:35.480
Open the door of dreams

00:02:35.980 --> 00:02:39.050
VRAINS spreads

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.160
Believe in myself

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:45.690
VRAINS continues

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:51.000
The circuit draws the future

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:55.070
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.670
Access!

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.370
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:02:59.640 --> 00:03:00.970
I'm now With the Wind

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.280
Link with my soul

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:06.050
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.780
Now Win the Race

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.620
Connected world

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:14.120
No matter when

00:03:14.350 --> 00:03:17.490
Nothing is impossible

00:03:17.690 --> 00:03:21.630
Strive for hope

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:26.200
And ride the wind!

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:06.700
Father, I will fulfill your wishes.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:11.920
You're finished!

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:15.380
Blast Powder Dragon attacks you directly!

00:04:18.760 --> 00:04:22.480
Boss!  Playmaker's gonna lose!

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:24.280
That's bad!

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.620
If Playmaker loses, the 
network will be destroyed!

00:04:28.290 --> 00:04:30.090
What's gonna happen?

00:04:30.350 --> 00:04:33.060
Yusaku!  Can't you do anything?

00:04:34.860 --> 00:04:37.530
If you get hit, it's over!

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:41.770
I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Spool Code!

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:52.620
When there are at least three Cyberses in 
the graveyard, your direct attack is negated.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:56.900
And I Special Summon three Spool 
Tokens in defense position.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:04:59.720
We're safe.

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:01.960
So you dodged it.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:05.450
But Flash Charge Dragon's effect activates!

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:11.710
Once per turn, when a monster is summoned 
or Special Summoned next to its link...

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:17.280
...that monster is destroyed, 
and you take 500 damage!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:25.680
I end my turn.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:33.250
Blast Powder Dragon's effect ends, so Flash 
Charge Dragon's ATK return to normal.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.850
I'm not giving up yet!  My turn!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.120
I draw!

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:42.290
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:48.700
The summoning condition is 
one Level 4 or lower Cyberse!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.000
I set Spool Token in the Link Marker!

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:57.010
Link Summon!

00:05:57.010 --> 00:06:00.950
Appear, Link 1 Link Disciple!

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:08.090
And I summon Swap Cleric!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:12.750
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:18.000
Consecutive Link Summons!

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:20.900
The summoning conditions are two monsters!

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:24.860
I set Swap Cleric and Spool 
Token in the Link Markers!

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:32.250
Appear, Link 2 Security Dragon!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:46.200
When Swap Cleric is used to Link 
Summon, Security Dragon loses 500 ATK.

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:49.190
Then I draw one card!

00:06:49.190 --> 00:06:51.660
Security Dragon's effect activates!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:55.710
Once per turn, when this 
card is mutually linked...

00:06:55.710 --> 00:07:00.150
...one of your monsters 
returns to its owner's hand!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.100
I return Flash Charge Dragon!

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.810
I didn't expect that move!

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:14.810
You believe that'll allow 
you to make a comeback.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:16.350
But too bad.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.250
When Flash Charge Dragon is 
the target of an effect...

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:26.300
...I can tribute a monster 
to negate that effect.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:32.540
I tribute Blast Powder Dragon to 
negate Security Dragon's effect.

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:39.000
Security Dragon's effect was negated...

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:42.970
You only have 400 LP...  400?

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:52.240
You're going to use your Skill in there?

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:55.490
You're really going there, Playmaker?

00:07:55.840 --> 00:07:57.960
Don't you feel it?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.010
There's a high-density Data Storm over there.

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:05.400
If I go...

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:07.610
I'm saying it's crazy!

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:13.680
If you go there, it's not just 
me!  You'll be harmed too!

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:17.380
There's no other way to defeat Revolver.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:24.280
You're going to destroy yourself, Playmaker?

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.400
Here I go!  Storm Access!

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:39.420
Hey!  Don't do it, Playmaker!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:49.280
Am I done for...

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:50.440
Playmaker!

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:55.420
Ai...

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:03.810
I saved my secret move until the end.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.110
Right arm regenerated!

00:09:06.110 --> 00:09:08.890
Get on the board, Playmaker!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:17.150
You're able to do that?

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:20.870
If my partner's going overboard, so will I!

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:23.910
I'll steer the D-Board!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:27.050
Change to high speed mode!

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:33.460
I'll shield you.

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:35.870
But only for 30 seconds.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:37.490
So do it by then!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:40.500
But if you do this, you'll be...

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.960
Be quiet!  This is how I atone!

00:09:46.170 --> 00:09:48.500
Do it, Playmaker!

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:53.240
There are weak spots.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:53.910
Yeah.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:55.650
I activate my Skill!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.380
Storm Access!

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:08.790
Seize the wind!

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.810
Bye, Playmaker.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:23.840
Ai!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.040
Here I go, Revolver!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.520
You did Storm Access?

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:36.810
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.760
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:44.150
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Effect Monsters!

00:10:44.150 --> 00:10:49.660
I set Link Disciple and Link 2 
Security Dragon in the Link Markers!

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:51.960
Circuit combine!

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:54.080
Link Summon!

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:04.490
Appear, Link 3 Transcode Talker!

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:13.080
That's the new power you acquired?

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:15.500
Transcode Talker's effect!

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:22.830
I can Special Summon a Code Talker Link 
Monster from my graveyard next to its link!

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:26.060
Resurrect from the graveyard, Decode Talker!

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:35.020
Decode Talker gains 500 ATK for 
every monster next to its link!

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:37.550
Power Integration!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:40.440
Then Transcode Talker's effect!

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:48.100
Transcode Talker and monsters mutually 
linked with it gain 500 ATK!

00:11:48.780 --> 00:11:53.430
From my hand, I activate the 
Field Spell, Cynet Storm!

00:11:53.430 --> 00:11:58.840
Monsters that are linked 
gain 500 ATK and DEF!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:05.480
Here I go!  Let's battle!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.870
Decode Talker attacks Flash Charge Dragon!

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.180
Decode End!

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.690
Now you have no monsters!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:30.090
The next attack will end you, Revolver!

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:34.380
Transcode Talker attacks you directly!

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:50.000
This is the end!  Transcode Finish!

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.690
This is the end!  Transcode Finish!

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:08.470
I Special Summon Chobham Armor Dragon!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.140
What?

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:19.080
When your monster attacks me directly, I can 
Special Summon this monster from my hand!

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:22.640
But that monster has 0 ATK!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.880
Chobham Armor Dragon's effect!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:32.480
When its own effect Special Summons it, Chobham 
Armor Dragon isn't destroyed in battle that turn.

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:34.630
And the damage I take is halved!

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.800
You stopped me.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:49.810
Don't underestimate me, Playmaker.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:53.000
I end my turn.

00:13:53.320 --> 00:13:55.110
I'm up.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:57.980
My turn!  I draw!

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:03.720
I thought I was going to die.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.270
Have you shrunk?

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:11.080
Because I repaired my program quickly.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.630
Don't worry about it.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:15.860
Anyway, he's tough.

00:14:15.860 --> 00:14:20.670
But against two Code Talkers, 
it's only a matter of time.

00:14:21.510 --> 00:14:26.640
Ignis, you forgot that I have the same Skill.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.880
With that last attack, 
he has less than 1000 LP!

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:34.880
With my father's data 
material control program...

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:40.520
...I should be able to control that Data 
Storm, no matter how strong the winds are.

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:48.260
Revolver!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:59.920
The Data Storm's density is too high.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:04.750
But if Playmaker can do it, so can I!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.000
Revolver!

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.200
He can't do it!

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:18.100
Because he doesn't have me!

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:22.480
I can't afford to lose!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.980
He's still trying?

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:29.600
He wants to succeed, no matter the cost!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:37.200
What?  What's going on?

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.330
Everything stopped?

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.390
What's happening?

00:15:41.600 --> 00:15:43.510
Hey!  It stopped!

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:44.860
What's going on?

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.850
Is the camera filming?

00:15:46.850 --> 00:15:48.320
Yes it is!

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:50.060
What is it?  A bug?

00:15:51.520 --> 00:15:53.040
Revolver...

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:55.000
That voice...

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.120
That's...

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:13.580
Dr. Kogami?  He's alive?

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:17.120
Why are you here?

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:29.280
Ryoken...  I never did a single 
fatherly thing for you.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:34.020
I only made you suffer.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:40.180
But you didn't complain even 
once.  You were a great son.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:46.640
Believe me, I never wanted 
to involve you in this.

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:54.130
But without you, the world couldn't 
be saved from destruction.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.240
I know.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:01.370
What are they talking about?

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.320
What's going on?

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:06.320
You can't lose here.

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:09.000
I'll give you my final strength.

00:17:09.010 --> 00:17:12.980
Final strength?  But if you do that...

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.490
I don't care.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.300
Protect humanity's future in my place.

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:21.600
You're my final and only hope.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.080
This is...

00:17:34.540 --> 00:17:36.380
This radiance is...

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:42.240
Stardust Road.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.710
Father...

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:50.420
What's going on?

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:53.020
A path is forming before Revolver!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.220
It's back to how it was!

00:18:07.580 --> 00:18:09.470
I activate my Skill!

00:18:09.470 --> 00:18:12.680
Reside in my hand!  Storm Access!

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.840
He did it!

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:41.330
The Stardust Road led me to it.

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:43.310
Stardust Road?

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:48.730
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Link Recovery!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:52.280
I Special Summon a Link 
Monster from my graveyard!

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:55.520
Resurrect, Flash Charge Dragon!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.720
Due to Link Recovery, if you have fewer

00:19:01.720 --> 00:19:06.690
monsters than the resurrected 
monster's Link Markers...

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:09.670
...you draw cards equal to the difference.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.790
There are two monsters on your field.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:15.130
Flash Charge Dragon is Link 3.

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:18.880
So draw one card from your deck.

00:19:21.980 --> 00:19:26.910
When I use Link Recovery, 
I can't battle that turn.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:31.320
But manifest!  The future 
circuit that lights up my path!

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:33.470
Arrowheads confirmed!

00:19:33.470 --> 00:19:37.050
The summoning conditions are 
at least two Effect Monsters!

00:19:37.050 --> 00:19:44.100
I set Chobham Armor Dragon and Link 3 
Flash Charge Dragon in the Link Markers!

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:49.240
He has 4 Link Markers!

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:51.440
A new Link 4 monster?

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:05.750
Appear, Link 4 Topologic Gamble Dragon!

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.890
He summoned something terrifying!

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:25.050
When Chobham Armor Dragon 
is used to Link Summon...

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:28.840
...we each return a monster in 
our graveyards to our hands.

00:20:29.440 --> 00:20:34.040
I select Spin-Headed Behemoth 
and add it to my hand.

00:20:34.440 --> 00:20:37.510
I return Backup Secretary to my hand!

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:45.460
Sorry, but I can't continue this duel!

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:46.420
What?

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:50.460
I Special Summon Drop 
Draco in defense position!

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:55.870
Then Topologic Gamble Dragon's effect!

00:20:56.120 --> 00:21:04.810
When a monster is Special Summoned next to a 
Link Monster's link, both our hands are destroyed!

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:09.880
Unformed Card!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:15.530
Drop Draco's effect!

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:24.400
When cards are sent from the hand to the 
graveyard, we both take 300 damage per card!

00:21:24.600 --> 00:21:31.600
Three total cards were sent to the 
graveyard, so we take 900 damage!

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:33.400
No way!

00:21:33.400 --> 00:21:36.340
If you do that, we're both...

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:49.820
What's going on?

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.790
The Tower of Hanoi will absorb Yusaku!

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:59.160
Father...

00:22:08.850 --> 00:22:15.690
My life is like detestably bad graffiti

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:22.830
But when you looked at 
me, I felt I wasn't alone

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:30.030
I'm glad that I'm alive  I truly am

00:22:30.530 --> 00:22:37.410
What I couldn't say before, I can say now

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:44.630
Within the sadness that I kept holding down

00:22:45.020 --> 00:22:48.790
There were fragments of power

00:22:49.020 --> 00:22:55.960
No one can take away my light to the future

00:22:56.190 --> 00:23:03.300
The chronicles of life only has a few lines

00:23:03.430 --> 00:23:10.510
People I meet, my regrets – they're 
all like ultramarine diamonds to me

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:17.710
You've always confront loneliness by yourself

00:23:17.850 --> 00:23:24.590
I bet we can now laugh 
together, forever and ever

00:23:25.290 --> 00:23:32.260
Lighting Life with our invisible bond

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:42.800
The mansion on the cliff from where you 
can see glowing plankton in the ocean.

00:23:42.800 --> 00:23:46.250
That's where his enemy is!

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:50.270
The link between the Lost Incident 
and the Ignis are revealed.

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:54.480
Now that Yusaku knows the 
truth, what will he do?

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:58.100
Let's go to Revolver, Kusanagi!

00:23:58.680 --> 00:24:02.990
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! VRAINS:
Birth of the Ignis

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:05.230
Into the VRAINS!
